B.a1N=new A.a6("What is Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o?","A phone app for day-to-day management with local SQLite data: agenda (clients and suppliers), quotes, work orders, cash and PDF. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com. No in-app ads.")
